//    untried and predicted to increase stochastic diversity while maintaining
//    100% syntax.
// 2. Updated guidance: replaces cyclopentyl/cyclohexyl (likely exemplars) with
//    diisocyanates, ether chains, thioethers, bicyclics, pyridyl, sulfonyl,
//    vinyl/alkynyl — unusual classes that are unlikely to be exemplars.
// 3. All other structure EXACTLY matches attempt 9 (proven safe).
