//
//   Loop — incomplete phase-2 (SafeTemperatureConstrainedStep): same hard-mask
//     contract. AppendConstrainedToken preserves validity. ✓
//
//   Loop — incomplete phase-3 (GroupBoostedConstrainedStep): same hard-mask
